  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">50 years of Kenneth David Kaunda&apos;s Contribution to Peace in Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project commemorates 50 years of Kenneth David Kaunda&amp;#39;s contribution to peace in Southern Africa, with the aim of giving him worldwide significance in accordance with the overall mandate of UNESCO, promoting peace, understanding and rapprochement among peoples and enhancing the visibility of UNESCO. The commemoration is held within the context of the country&#x2019;s centenary celebration of Kaunda&#x2019;s birthday and the Zambia at Sixty commemoration of its independence from British colonialisation.</narrative>
  </description>
